  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the lamb, self-raising flour, onion, carrot, celery, turmeric, cumin, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Mix well with your hands or a wooden spoon until just combined.",
    "Thread the mixture onto skewers, leaving a little space between each piece.",
    "Brush the skewers with olive oil.",
    "Place the skewers on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Bake for 20 minutes, then turn the skewers over and bake for an additional 15 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh parsley or cilantro if desired."
  ],
